 *
 * `clip` points at the local 30-second silent cut in public/videos where one
 * has been encoded. Everything else falls back to a YouTube embed, and every
 * card links out for the full piece either way.
 *
 * TODO: `description` is the thin factual credit taken from the deck. This is
 * the part of the card the layout is built around -- worth real copy.
 */
